    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Rockon Blocks adds simple, good-looking content blocks to the WordPress block editor, so you can make your posts easier to scan without touching code.</p>\n<p><strong>Included blocks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pros &amp; Cons Box</strong> – show the good and the bad side by side. Stacks neatly on mobile.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Takeaways Card</strong> – summarize the most important points of a post.</li>\n<li><strong>Callout Box</strong> – draw attention to a tip or note (info style).</li>\n<li><strong>Review Summary Box</strong> – close a review with a 5-star rating (half stars supported) and a final verdict.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Rockon Blocks?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>No build tools, no bloat – only a few KB of CSS and JS.</li>\n<li>Lightweight CSS and JS – the editor script only loads in the block editor.</li>\n<li>Change font size, background color, text color and border from the block settings.</li>\n<li>No ads, no tracking, no external requests.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A Pro version with more layouts, styling options and extra blocks is in development.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>rockon-blocks</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>, or install it from the Plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Edit a post, click the <strong>+</strong> inserter and look for the <strong>Rockon Blocks</strong> category.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The blocks use their own self-contained styles and work with classic and block themes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20the%20colors%3F\">\nCan I change the colors?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Every block has background color, text color and border color/width settings in the block sidebar. The upcoming Pro version will add gradients, border styles, shadows, custom icons and saved style templates.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20collect%20any%20data%3F\">\nDoes it collect any data?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin makes no external requests and collects no personal data. It only stores which blocks you have switched off on the Rockon Blocks settings page, and removes that setting when you delete the plugin.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release: Pros &amp; Cons Box, Key Takeaways Card, Callout Box, Review Summary Box.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Clean, fast Gutenberg blocks for bloggers: Pros &amp; Cons box, Key Takeaways card, Callout box and Review Summary box.",
    "description": "<p>Rockon Blocks adds simple, good-looking content blocks to the WordPress block editor, so you can make your posts easier to scan without touching code.</p>\n<p><strong>Included blocks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pros &amp; Cons Box</strong> – show the good and the bad side by side. Stacks neatly on mobile.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Takeaways Card</strong> – summarize the most important points of a post.</li>\n<li><strong>Callout Box</strong> – draw attention to a tip or note (info style).</li>\n<li><strong>Review Summary Box</strong> – close a review with a 5-star rating (half stars supported) and a final verdict.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Rockon Blocks?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>No build tools, no bloat – only a few KB of CSS and JS.</li>\n<li>Lightweight CSS and JS – the editor script only loads in the block editor.</li>\n<li>Change font size, background color, text color and border from the block settings.</li>\n<li>No ads, no tracking, no external requests.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A Pro version with more layouts, styling options and extra blocks is in development.</p>\n",
